# Secrets stay local

When pushing or committing this plugin to GitHub:

- Never put WiFi passwords, API keys, or other secrets in tracked files.
- Keep real credentials only in local `includes/esp32/wifi_secrets.h` (gitignored).
- GitHub should have `wifi_secrets.h.example` with empty placeholders.
- Local copies such as `gym.ino` may keep passwords. Do not copy those values into git.

If firmware needs WiFi settings, `#include "wifi_secrets.h"` from `esp32.ino`.
